      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "01E16763DBE19008",
      "text": "欢迎来到深钵道馆！\\n需要再听一次\\r\\n道馆测验的说明吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "01E16A63DBE19521",
      "text": "深钵道馆的道馆测验是\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]收集向日花怪[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "01E16963DBE1936E",
      "text": "收集[VAR 0x0201(0001)]只深钵镇中\\n又像太阳又像花儿的宝可梦，\\r\\n也就是向日花怪。\\c\\n并把它们带到向日花怪广场的话，\\n就能通过道馆测验！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "01E16C63DBE19887",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n你现在已经收集了[VAR 0x0200(0001)]只，\\r\\n所以还差[VAR 0x0201(0002)]只。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
