    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_01",
      "hash64": "3530CCAE0E1378E7",
      "text": "我是向日花怪姐姐！\\n负责照顾道馆的向日花怪们哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_06",
      "hash64": "3530C9AE0E1373CE",
      "text": "你是来收集向日花怪的\\n道馆测验挑战者吧！\\c\\n我这就让向日花怪们\\n分散到镇上去咯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_07",
      "hash64": "3530CAAE0E137581",
      "text": "向～日～向～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_09",
      "hash64": "3530C4AE0E136B4F",
      "text": "向日花怪们都准备好了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_10",
      "hash64": "3533D1AE0E15B73D",
      "text": "道馆测验开始！\\n等你收集了[VAR 0x0201(0001)]只向日花怪后，\\r\\n就把它们带到这个向日花怪广场来吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_11",
      "hash64": "3533D0AE0E15B58A",
      "text": "那么，请去找吧！\\n向日花怪们就拜托你了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_02",
      "hash64": "3530CDAE0E137A9A",
      "text": "你带着的向日花怪……\\n有[VAR 0x0201(0001)]只！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_03",
      "hash64": "3530CEAE0E137C4D",
      "text": "等你收集了[VAR 0x0201(0002)]只后，\\n就把它们带到这个广场来吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_04",
      "hash64": "3530C7AE0E137068",
      "text": "谢谢你收集向日花怪！\\n你通过道馆测验了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_keeper_05",
      "hash64": "3530C8AE0E13721B",
      "text": "去深钵道馆的前台报告吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "01E16E63DBE19BED",
      "text": "要再挑战一次收集向日花怪\\n这个道馆测验吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "01E16D63DBE19A3A",
      "text": "那么，请再次收集\\n[VAR 0x0201(0001)]只向日花怪，\\r\\n把它们带到这个广场来吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "01E16063DBE18423",
      "text": "那么，请去找吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_10",
      "hash64": "F905C97956842618",
      "text": "一旦出了镇子，\\n向日花怪就得从头收集。\\r\\n……即使如此也要离开镇子吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_11",
      "hash64": "F905CA79568427CB",
      "text": "放弃道馆测验了！\\n想再次挑战时，\\r\\n就去向日花怪广场吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "gym_kusa_020_kusapoke_12",
      "hash64": "F905CB795684297E",
      "text": "要放弃收集向日花怪吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
